# Keep the build context small and force a clean install/build inside the image.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/coverage
**/.turbo
# Stale incremental-build state would make tsc think dist is already up to date
# (and skip emitting) — but dist is excluded above, so the build must be fresh.
**/*.tsbuildinfo
.git
.github
**/*.log
**/.DS_Store
e2e/playwright-report
e2e/test-results
benchmarks/results
